  "metaDescription": "The Corruption Eradication Commission is searching a notary office in Surabaya and summoning officials as part of a corruption probe into the ATR BPN.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The Corruption Eradication Commission (KPK) searched a notary office and residential premises in Surabaya to investigate alleged corruption within the ATR BPN.",
    "Investigators summoned the Mojokerto Land Office head as a witness regarding the ongoing case linked to the Ministry of ATR BPN.",
    "The KPK is also investigating claims of improper honorarium payments involving DPRD members and the non-active Regent of Klaten."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Corruption Eradication Commission (KPK) is actively pursuing multiple investigations across Indonesia. Recent actions involve a probe into alleged corruption at the Ministry of Agrarian Affairs and Spatial Planning/National Land Agency (ATR BPN), which has included the search of a notary office and residences in Surabaya. Additionally, investigators have summoned the head of the Mojokerto Land Office for questioning. In a separate development, the commission is examining allegations against the non-active Regent of Klaten, Hamenang Wajar Ismoyo, concerning the potential abuse of authority for a record-breaking event. The KPK is also investigating claims that DPRD and regional leadership council members in Klaten received honorariums that did not align with established regulations. These efforts are part of broader ongoing anti-corruption initiatives managed by the commission across several administrative districts and government institutions.",
